# Matched position feedback comparison on all forty LAFAN1 motions.
# Choose --position-feedback encoder or decoder and --seed explicitly at launch.
# Stop after 9,000 completed outer updates. The launcher supplies the finite wall budget.
@base/action_target.args
--policy-ema --lr-warmup-steps 100
--physics engine --residual-action
--enc-hoist off
--iters 9000
